    for some $S\ge 0$, then condition \eqref{H1} holds with $\bar \kappa = 2\dist(x^0, \Fix(T)) + {S}$. 

    In particular, if $\sum_n \sigma_n <+\infty$ then  \eqref{H2} holds. 
\end{itemize}
}
\end{lemma}

